            <rdf:value xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">This model runs in PCEnv and is based off the NEURON code for this paper. The units are continuous throughout but the model does not recreate the published results. It utilizes DAE solving techniques and advances in these could result in better output.</rdf:value>
